"Der durchschnittliche tägliche Prozentsatz der Geräte, die Ergebnisse "
"senden, ausgenommen Wochenenden."

#. [component.Widget.avgTimeToUploadDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average delay of uploading results, in hours. Only considering results where the delay was greater than two hours.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The average delay of uploading results, in hours. Only considering results "
"where the delay was greater than two hours."
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Verzögerung beim Hochladen der Ergebnisse in Stunden. "
"Nur unter Berücksichtigung von Ergebnissen, bei denen die Verzögerung größer "
"als zwei Stunden war."

#. [component.Widget.averageDurationServiceInterruptionDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average duration of a service interruption, in days. The period of interruption will be the date range between the device was flagged as "Down for repair" and when it back to be active again
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The average duration of a service interruption, in days. The period of "
"interruption will be the date range between the device was flagged as \"Down "
"for repair\" and when it back to be active again"
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Dauer einer Dienstunterbrechung in Tagen. Der Zeitraum "
"der Unterbrechung ist der Zeitraum zwischen der Kennzeichnung des Geräts als "
"\"Zur Reparatur außer Betrieb\" und dem Zeitpunkt, zu dem es wieder aktiv ist"

#. [component.Widget.averageRecipientsOfSmsDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average number of SMS recipients per positive result.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid "The average number of SMS recipients per positive result."
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Anzahl von SMS-Empfängern pro positivem GeneXpert-"
"Ergebnis."

#. [component.Widget.averageLengthOfSmsDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average number of characters in SMS messages sent about positive results.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The average number of characters in SMS messages sent about positive results."
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Anzahl von Zeichen in SMS-Nachrichten, die über "
"positive GeneXpert-Ergebnisse gesendet wurden."

#. [component.Widget.averageDaysModuleSwapDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average number of days between the last result reported under a replaced module serial and the new module serial in that module slot reporting its first result. The module swap issue appears when two consecutive results performed in the same device's slot, they have a different module serial number
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The average number of days between the last result reported under a replaced "
"module serial and the new module serial in that module slot reporting its "
"first result. The module swap issue appears when two consecutive results "
"performed in the same device's slot, they have a different module serial "
"number"
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Anzahl von Tagen zwischen dem letzten Ergebnis, das "
"unter einer ausgetauschten Modulserie gemeldet wurde, und der Meldung des "
"ersten Ergebnisses der neuen Modulserie in diesem Modulsteckplatz. Das "
"Problem des Modultauschs tritt auf, wenn zwei aufeinanderfolgende Ergebnisse "
"im selben Steckplatz des Geräts eine unterschiedliche Modulseriennummer haben"

#. [component.Widget.instrumentsReplacedDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average number of days between when an instrument serial last reported from a GeneXpert device and a new instrument serial reporting. An Instrument is marked as replaced when two consecutive results performed in the same device, have a different Instrument serial number
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The average number of days between when an instrument serial last reported "
"from a GeneXpert device and a new instrument serial reporting. An Instrument "
"is marked as replaced when two consecutive results performed in the same "
"device, have a different Instrument serial number"
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Anzahl von Tagen zwischen der letzten Meldung einer "
"Instrumentenserie von einem Gerät und der Meldung einer neuen "
"Instrumentenserie. Ein Instrument wird als ersetzt markiert, wenn zwei "
"aufeinanderfolgende Ergebnisse, die mit demselben Gerät durchgeführt wurden, "
"eine unterschiedliche Instrumentenseriennummer aufweisen"

#. [component.Widget.averageRecipientsOfEmailDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average number of email recipients per positive result.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid "The average number of email recipients per positive result."
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Anzahl der E-Mail-Empfänger pro positivem GeneXpert-"
"Ergebnis."

#. [component.Widget.averageTimeToModuleReplacementDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average time (in days) between when a module was disabled and a different module serial being detected in the same slot.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The average time (in days) between when a module was disabled and a "
"different module serial being detected in the same slot."
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Zeit (in Tagen) zwischen der Deaktivierung eines "
"Moduls und der Erkennung einer anderen Modulserie auf demselben Steckplatz."

#. [component.Widget.serverUptimeDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The average uptime of the Aspect server this month.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid "The average uptime of the Aspect server this month."
msgstr ""
"Die durchschnittliche Verfügbarkeit des Aspect-Servers in diesem Monat."

#. [legends.Unknown.hover]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The device hasn't connected to Aspect for several days. It may be running tests, but the tests aren't uploaded to Aspect yet.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The device hasn't connected to Aspect for several days. It may be running "
"tests, but the tests aren't uploaded to Aspect yet."
msgstr ""
"Das Gerät ist seit mehreren Tagen nicht mehr mit Aspect verbunden. Es führt "
"möglicherweise Tests durch, aber die Tests sind noch nicht zu Aspect "
"hochgeladen."

#. [component.Widget.errorRateDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The error rate is calculated by counting all errors in the tests conducted in the month and dividing that number by the total tests carried out of all devices.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The error rate is calculated by counting all errors in the tests conducted "
"in the month and dividing that number by the total tests carried out of all "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Die Fehlerrate wird berechnet, indem alle Fehler in den im Monat "
"durchgeführten Tests gezählt und diese Zahl durch die Gesamtzahl der von "
"allen Geräten durchgeführten Tests dividiert wird."

#. [pages.Notifications.notificationNameRequired]
