#. [pages.ReportIndex.devicePerformance_description]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. This report shows performance rates by device and assay, including: errors, activity, utilization, days offline, and average delay to upload tests. Scoped only to Cepheid GeneXpert devices.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"This report shows performance rates by device and assay, including: errors, "
"activity, utilization, days offline, and average delay to upload tests. "
"Scoped only to Cepheid GeneXpert devices."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Bericht zeigt die Leistungsraten nach Gerät und Assay, "
"einschließlich: Fehler, Aktivität, Auslastung, Offline-Tage und "
"durchschnittliche Verzögerung beim Hochladen von Tests. Nur auf Cepheid "
"GeneXpert-Geräte beschränkt."

#. [pages.ReportIndex.device_activity_description]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. This report shows the activity of the devices during the selected period of time, breaking it down by months (By default last 12 months), and all the tests performed during the last year.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"This report shows the activity of the devices during the selected period of "
"time, breaking it down by months (By default last 12 months), and all the "
"tests performed during the last year."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Bericht zeigt die Aktivität der Geräte während des ausgewählten "
"Zeitraums, aufgeschlüsselt nach Monaten (standardmäßig die letzten 12 "
"Monate), sowie alle im letzten Jahr durchgeführten Tests."

#. [pages.ReportIndex.device_activity_percent_description]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. This report shows the activity percentage, per month, of the devices during the selected period of time. (By default last 12 months)
#: extracted_strings.json
